    "text": "A gas can be taken from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> via two different processes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ACB</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ADB</mi></math>.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c66bfb8f-12d1-4f88-a003-8d04f817e5fd-D561.png\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 189px;\" /><br /><br />When path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ACB</mi></math> is used <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of heat flows into the system and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of work is done by the system. If the path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ADB</mi></math> is&nbsp;used then work done by the system is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>, the heat flows into the system in the path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ADB</mi></math> is:",
