  "solution": {
    "text": "For path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ACB</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;W</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br />For path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ADB</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;W</mi></math><br /><br />As initial and find points are the same, change in internal energy is same in both the cases<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
